scn 1
# Three Aramon flying builders (arafly) in one cell repair one damaged Keep (air_traffic hurts it and gives
# the order at tick 2). VTOL_RepairUnit wakes every tick of its work, and at 8 on the air-traffic counter
# (421066) steps the builder out of the stack (VTOL_StepOutNoFormation, StopBuilding) and starts again from
# its approach. Through protocol 307's first cut the builders orbited the Keep as one stack.
name air-stack-repair
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type flyb fbi arafly
type keep fbi arakeep
group builders 0 flyb 3 cells 40,80 40,80 40,80
group keep 0 keep 1 cells 70,80
pair stack builders builders cells=2
